 three minute  lessons in sign language each morning  one of the students named sahara  volunteers to help shoko shoya and the  rest of the gang find another  opportunity to bully shoko he writes  some hurtful stuff on the board and  pretends someone else has done it he  even erases it for her shoko unaware of  his intentions thanks him for erasing  the message the next day in class shoya  yells into shoko's ears and she gets  startled everyone's surprised that she  can hear the girl with the blackhead  named naoko later checks shoko's ears  and finds out that she's wearing a  hearing aid the girl asks her to show  her the hearing aid and throws him  towards shoya who throws them outside  the deaf girl becomes a victim of  shoya's bullying every day in different  forms one day things go too far and  shoko starts bleeding for which the boy  gets into trouble after when shoya and  his friends are about to leave for home  shoko confronts them and has a message  for them which is written down on her  notebook she says i am sorry and that  she and shoya are friends shawya doesn't  like that he throws away a notebook in  the fountain water and continues to walk  away shulker gets inside the puddle of  water to pull out her notebook the next  day the principal addresses the class  and informs everyone that shoko is  absent today they received a call from  her mother who told them that eight of  her hearing aids have gone missing or  been damaged the principal also informs  the class that the girl's mother has  complained that she's being bullied at  school he asks all the students to let  him know if they've witnessed shoko  being bullied or become a victim of  harassment her hearing aids are quite  expensive and the one responsible for  this can get in a lot of trouble  therefore it's best to come out on their  own the teacher speaks up he asks troyer  to stand up because everyone knows it's  him who's been bullying the girl when  shoya says he wasn't the only one all  his friends turn against him shoya's  mother receives a call from the school  she asks shoya to prepare to meet the  girl and apologize to her on their way  she withdraws money from the bank and  gives it to the girl's mother for the  damage soya has caused to her hearing  aid showa's mother advises him to be a  good boy from tomorrow now the tables  have turned shawya becomes the victim of  bullying he finds shoko in the classroom  cleaning his desk after all that's  happened the boy's surprised to see her  smile he believes she's faking it she  must be angry and that she's pretending  to be a good girl as a result the two  get into a fight and start hitting each  other shorkor's now moved to another  school shoya discovers and saves a  notepad that shoko left behind fast  forward a few years later shoya a  melancholy loner who can't look others  in the eyes and imagines an x sign over  the faces of people has been an outcast  since middle school for his reputation  as a bully to tie up the loose ends the  boy goes to the sign language club there  he spots a girl with long hair who looks  similar to shoko he reaches out to her  and introduces himself shoko smiles  again but tries to run after the brief  encounter shoya runs after her and says  he came to give her the notebook that  she left back in school he used his sign  language to talk to her shoko stand to  learn that the boy who practically  refused to learn sign language now knows  it the girl gets all teared up upon  receiving the notebook in sign language  shoya tells her that they can be friends  wait a second the boy now realizes what  she used to say back to him in the  school days alas it was a dream the boy  was dreaming about making amends with  the deaf girl next morning shoya has  breakfast with his mother who's pleased  to receive the money she happens to know  about her son's attempt to jump from a  bridge and brings it up at the table she  yells at him and asks him to promise  that he'll never do it again surya soon  realizes that he's got to take  responsibility for what he did to shoko  and hence has isolated himself from  everything even his friends had turned  their back on him another loner domohiro  befriends shoya after he saves him from  a bully the two become friends and start  hanging out often shoya tries to see  shoko by visiting her at school but  shoko's friend yuzuru doesn't let him  see her when he tries to talk to her the  second time domohiro pops up out of  nowhere he's been following his friend  and asks yuzuru to allow the two to meet  finally the two meeting shoya tells her  that he's been looking for an excuse to  meet her for a really long time shoko  tells that she wanted to meet him too  and together the two begin feeding bread  to the fish in the river while they're  talking shoko wanted to read her old  notebook but shoya doesn't want her to  remember the past and tries to take it  hence the notebook accidentally falls  into the river the girl jumps into the  river to retrieve it and shoya follows  her they managed to grab the notebook  and climb out of the river safely shoko  tells shoya that they'll see each other  again unhappy with everything that's  happened yuzuru takes a photo of shoya  jumping in and puts it online as a form  of revenge the next day everyone in  school is talking about this incident  and showing us stunned to see his  picture posted online since jumping into  the river is illegal shoya gets a  suspension for this act  shorya comes across yuzuru who's run  away from home hiding in the kids  playground sleeping in one of the boxes  shoya wonders if yuzuru is shoko's  boyfriend as they talk yuzuru confesses  about the picture posted online shoya  who was out in the park with maria his  sister's kid asks yuzuru to go home as  he leaves the park too uzuru is too  tight to get up so he drags and takes  uzuru home to give him something to eat  it's night time and everyone's asleep  yuzuru remembers shoko's words 