ere he discovers that shoko blames  herself for everything that has happened  to him shoya makes the decision to focus  his entire life on the sisters shoko  travels home under the pretense of  finishing schoolwork during a fireworks  event when uzuru asks him to get her  camera shoya obliges when he comes he  finds shoko on the balcony trying to do  something stupid but shoya manages to  catch her and drag her to safety but he  falls into the river below he's saved by  his former elementary school best  buddies unfortunately he falls into a  coma shoko meets with each of the group  members to discuss her and shorya's  problems in the hopes of assisting shoya  naoka accuses shoko about what happened  to shoya and tries to slap her but  shoko's mother comes and stops her shoko  sees a dream about showing her paying  her a farewell visit one night she  rushes to the bridge terrified and  collapses shaw wakes up from his coma  and wanders to the bridge where he finds  shoko he apologizes for how he treated  her asking her to stop blaming herself  shoya then asks her to help him in  staying alive and she agrees  shorya is reunited with his pals when he  returns to school and he realizes how  much they still care about him sure  discovers that he can finally look  people in the eyes again when he  visualizes the x marks fading away as  the pals attend the school festival  together shoya sobs as he looks around  his family and all his new friends  knowing that he's finally atoned for his  sins and then the movie ends so this is  it for today's video if you like the  video give it a huge thumbs up and  subscribe to the channel for more videos  farewell till next time

